  "rules": {
    "objective": "Be the first to collect five tokens to win the pot; players also compete in side bets matching the pot amount each time multiple players declare yes.",
    "gameplay": "Ante. Stage 1: 2 cards, declare yes/no (best high 2-card). Stage 2: 3 community cards, yes/no (best LOW 5-card). Stage 3: 2 more hole cards, yes/no (best HIGH 5-card of 7). Single yes=1 token. Multiple yes=show hands, loser pays pot-sized side bet to winner.",
    "keyRules": [
      "Three-stage game (2-card/5-low/7-high)",
